AUDIO: 'it drops to about 8 seconds per iteration.&nbsp; The total generation time was 187 seconds,&nbsp;&nbsp; but the quality is noticeably lower compared&nbsp; to the result we saw earlier. I ran the same&nbsp;&nbsp;'

